# A single `task` dispatch: the subagents panel appears live while it
# runs, then freezes into the transcript once it finishes (subagents.go).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-task-single.yaml
@fixture testdata/behaviour/design
@args --permission-mode acceptEdits

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE survey the redis mock with a subagent
KEY enter
WAITFOR /subagents running in parallel|subagents finished/ 20
SHOT subagent-live
EXPECT /subagents/
# A single dispatch of a type keeps that type's plain short name
# (subagents.go's assignDisplayNamesLocked): "general-purpose" -> its
# first word, "general" — 7 columns, fitting the 8-column name slot
# (subagentNameWidth) without truncation. The "-N" index only appears
# when several dispatches share a type (task-concurrent.steps).
EXPECT /general/
WAITFOR /Confirmed: the mock is missing/ 20
SHOT subagent-done
EXPECT /1 subagents finished/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
